target/
artifacts/
coverage/
# Ignore fuzzer-generated corpus entries but keep the committed seed inputs.
# A blanket `corpus/` ignored the tracked seeds below too, making them
# "committed AND ignored" — which broke release-plz. Negate exactly the tracked
# seeds so generated/local corpus files stay ignored (no untracked noise).
corpus/*/*
!corpus/fuzz_open/flat.vmdk
!corpus/fuzz_open/flat-f001.vmdk
!corpus/fuzz_open/minimal.vmdk
!corpus/fuzz_open/stream_opt.vmdk
